1
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:07,916
A Singapore property agent closing a new-launch condo juggles hard legal deadlines —

2
00:00:07,956 --> 00:00:10,691
S&P in three weeks, stamp duty in fourteen days —

3
00:00:10,731 --> 00:00:13,522
and every document has to match the buyer exactly.

4
00:00:13,562 --> 00:00:17,146
Miss one, and the buyer can lose a quarter of their booking fee.

5
00:00:17,186 --> 00:00:19,750
Today that lives in spreadsheets and WhatsApp.

6
00:00:21,223 --> 00:00:23,752
Closing Copilot is built on Google Cloud.

7
00:00:23,792 --> 00:00:27,573
The agent snaps the buyer's NRIC — even a tilted phone photo.

8
00:00:33,144 --> 00:00:39,743
Document AI reads it, Gemini structures it, and the customer record is created with the ID masked everywhere.

9
00:00:39,783 --> 00:00:43,215
Due-diligence is recorded, and the image is never stored.

10
00:00:44,305 --> 00:00:49,735
When the developer's lawyer sends the Sale & Purchase Agreement, Copilot cross-checks it against the verified buyer.

11
00:00:50,275 --> 00:00:54,906
Here it caught a missing letter in the name and two swapped digits in the NRIC —

12
00:00:54,946 --> 00:00:56,248
before the buyer signs.

13
00:00:56,288 --> 00:00:59,985
Gemini reads; plain code compares, so every flag is explainable.

14
00:01:05,318 --> 00:01:07,392
Most selling happens on WhatsApp.

15
00:01:07,432 --> 00:01:09,377
The agent screenshots the chat;

16
00:01:09,417 --> 00:01:11,490
Gemini turns it into a customer —

17
00:01:11,530 --> 00:01:13,347
budget, family, preferences —

18
00:01:13,387 --> 00:01:16,229
plus dated follow-ups for every promise made.

19
00:01:21,668 --> 00:01:24,338
Nothing is saved until the agent confirms.

20
00:01:27,641 --> 00:01:32,933
Then Copilot matches him against twenty-four real 2025–26 launches:

21
00:01:32,973 --> 00:01:36,991
an EC in Pasir Ris that fits his family and budget.

22
00:01:38,081 --> 00:01:40,727
The relationship doesn't end at the keys.

23
00:01:40,767 --> 00:01:45,247
From a chat and a profile screenshot, Copilot built Mr Goh's circle —

24
00:01:45,287 --> 00:01:48,391
with his consent, as Singapore's PDPA requires —

25
00:01:48,431 --> 00:01:50,094
and his after-sales needs:

26
00:01:50,134 --> 00:01:53,632
finding a tenant, furnishing, declaring rental income.

27
00:01:54,172 --> 00:02:01,402
Birthdays, anniversaries, lease renewals and tax deadlines land in one reminders list, and Copilot drafts the message.

28
00:02:02,492 --> 00:02:10,428
And when the agent just asks "what do I need to do today", the ADK agent checks deadlines, reminders and customer files through its tools —

29
00:02:10,468 --> 00:02:13,757
it never guesses a date, an amount or a stamp-duty figure;

30
00:02:13,797 --> 00:02:14,962
those come from code.

31
00:02:20,970 --> 00:02:28,328
Gemini on Vertex AI with the Agent Development Kit, Document AI, Google Search grounding, Firestore and Cloud Run —

32
00:02:28,368 --> 00:02:31,867
evaluated end to end, seven out of seven cases passing.

33
00:02:31,907 --> 00:02:37,400
Closing Copilot: fewer missed deadlines, deeper relationships, more time with clients.

